  "title": "CGI Federal launches AI-powered IT modernization offering, enabled by its proprietary digital workforce platform",
  "summary": "CGI Federal Inc. (CGI Federal) launched a breakthrough AI-powered IT modernization offering that gives federal agencies rapid, clear insight into their most complex legacy systems. Powered by CGI Federal’s Yukon, a proprietary AI workforce platform, the offering transforms decades of fragmented code and missing documentation into an actionable, mission-ready modernization roadmap.",
